[ai4PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from the King of Nimbus</h2>
Priest, if you let me go I'll let you live in peace by my side here in Nimbus.<br>
Will you accept my offer?
$Button=WHAT? AND DISOBEY HADES?,DoNothing,Continue
$Button=SURE,Tell,Youareintroublenow

[Youareintroublenow]
<h2>You receive a message from {sw_god5}</h2>
<p>PRIEST! What are you trying to do?<br>
You will be punished for this when you arrive back in Hell!
$Button=UH OH!,DoNothing,Continue

[ai4PriestDead]
<$Config,sw_enDead4=1>
